Board Aligned</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Ordinary &amp; Advanced Level</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-sfa-navy/5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar-range size-5 text-sfa-navy\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M16 2v3\"></path><path d=\"M3 9h18\"></path><path d=\"M8 2v3\"></path><path d=\"M17 13h-6\"></path><path d=\"M13 17H7\"></path><path d=\"M7 13h.01\"></path><path d=\"M17 17h.01\"></path></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-sfa-navy\">10+ Years of Past Papers</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">GCE &amp; Regional Mocks</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-sfa-navy/5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-video size-5 text-sfa-navy\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 13 5.223 3.482a.5.5 0 0 0 .777-.416V7.87a.5.5 0 0 0-.752-.432L16 10.5\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"6\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-sfa-navy\">Step-by-Step Video Corrections</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Fast streaming playback</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-sfa-navy/5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" clas