>Complete GCE and regional mock papers with downloadable PDF solutions for offline revision. Covers all subjects, Science &amp; Arts.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-sfa-navy opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100\">Learn more<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"group relative flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border/50 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg lg:p-8\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-orange-50 text-sfa-orange transition-colors duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-timer size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"10\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"2\" y2=\"2\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"15\" y1=\"14\" y2=\"11\"></line><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"14\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-sfa-navy\">Paper 1 Live Quiz Player</h3><p class=\"mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Timed MCQ practice under real exam conditions (120 min). Instant scoring, detailed explanations, and multi-image diagrams included.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-sfa-navy opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100\">Learn more<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"group relative flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border/50 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg lg:p-8\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-sky-50 text-sfa-sky transition-colors duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-sfa-navy\">Video Solutions (Streaming)</h3><p class=\"mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Step-by-step methodology videos by qualified teachers. Fast Bunny Stream playback so you never miss a concept.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-sfa-navy opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100\">Learn more<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"group relative flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border/50 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg lg:p-8\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 transition-colors duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v16\"></path><path d=\"M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-sfa-navy\">Complete Course Notes &amp; Summaries</h3><p class=\"mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Chapter-structured revision notes, concise summaries, and a book library, everything to consolidate key concepts before exam day.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-sfa-navy opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100\">Learn more<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"how-it-works\" class=\"relative scroll-mt-20 overflow-hidden py-20 lg:py-28\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-fixed bg-cover bg-center opacity-40\" style=\"background-image:url(/images/happy.avif)\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-white/40\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-sfa-orange\">Getting Started</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-sfa-navy sm:text-4xl\">Start Revising in 3 Simple Steps</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">From download to your first quiz, it takes less than 2 minutes.</p></div><div class=\"relative mt-16\"><div class=\"absolute top-14 left-0 right-0 hidden h-0.5 bg-linear-to-r from-sfa-navy via-sfa-orange to-sfa-sky lg:block\"></div><div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12\"><div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center text-center\"><div class=\"relative z-10 flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-sfa-navy text-white shadow-lg ring-4 ring-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15V3\"></path><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"mt-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400\">Step <!-- -->01</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-sfa-navy\">Download &amp; Create Your Account</h3><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Install the app and sign up in one tap with your Google account. No complex registration, just start learning.</p></div><div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center text-center\"><div class=\"relative z-10 flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-sfa-orange text-white shadow-lg ring-4 ring-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-list-checks size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13 5h8\"></path><path d=\"M13 12h8\"></path><path d=\"M13 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m3 17 2 2 4-4\"></path><path d=\"m3 7 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"mt-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400\">Step <!-- -->02</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-sfa-navy\">Select Your Level &amp; Stream</h3><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Choose Ordinary Level or Advanced Level, then pick Science or Arts. We tailor your dashboard to show only what matters for your exam.</p></div><div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center text-center\"><div class=\"relative z-10 flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-sfa-sky text-white shadow-lg ring-4 ring-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 7h6v6\"></path><path d=\"m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"mt-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400\">Step <!-- -->03</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-sfa-navy\">Practice &amp; Track Your Progress</h3><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Solve past papers, watch video solutions, take timed quizzes, and monitor your scores right up to exam day.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"overflow-hidden bg-sfa-bg py-20 lg:py-28\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-sfa-orange\">App Preview</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-sfa-navy sm:text-4xl\">See the App in Action</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">A clean, student-friendly interface built for focused revision. Browse papers, take quizzes, watch videos, and read notes, all from your phone.</p></div><div class=\"mt-14 flex gap-5 overflow-x-auto pb-6 snap-x snap-mandatory sm:gap-6 lg:items-end lg:justify-center lg:gap-8 scrollbar-none [-ms-overflow-style:none] [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden\"><div class=\"group flex shrink-0 snap-center flex-col items-center\" style=\"animation-delay:0ms\"><div class=\"relative w-48 origin-bottom overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border-[5px] border-slate-800 bg-s