-center\" style=\"animation-delay:300ms\"><div class=\"relative w-48 origin-bottom overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border-[5px] border-slate-800 bg-slate-800 shadow-xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-2 group-hover:rotate-0 sm:w-56 lg:rotate-6\"><img alt=\"Course notes and book library\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"600\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"aspect-9/18 w-full object-cover\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://www.school-forall.com/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flibrary.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75\"></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-sfa-navy\">Course Notes &amp; Library</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white py-20 lg:py-28\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"relative order-2 lg:order-1\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-4 -z-10 rounded-[2rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-sfa-orange/10 to-sfa-sky/10 blur-2xl\"></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-3xl shadow-xl\"><img alt=\"The School For All team collaborating\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"900\" height=\"700\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://www.school-forall.com/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteam.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75\"></div></div><div class=\"order-1 lg:order-2\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-sfa-orange\">Who We Are</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-sfa-navy sm:text-4xl\">Built by Cameroonians Who Lived the GCE</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">School For All started with a small team of educators, engineers, and former GCE candidates who know exactly how stressful exam preparation can be, especially without reliable access to past papers or clear explanations. We're building the resource we wish we had, so every student in Cameroon can prepare with confidence, wherever they are.</p><ul class=\"mt-6 space-y-2.5\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big size-4 shrink-0 text-green-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Founded by former GCE candidates</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big size-4 shrink-0 text-green-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Built with Cameroonian teachers</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big size-4 shrink-0 text-green-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Local support, in your language</li></ul><a class=\"mt-8 inline-block\" href=\"https://www.school-forall.com/about\"><button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slot=\"button\" class=\"group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border bg-clip-padding text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [&amp;_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-4 bg-background aria-expanded:bg-muted aria-expanded:text-foreground dark:border-input dark:bg-input/30 dark:hover:bg-input/50 h-9 has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2 gap-2 border-sfa-navy/20 px-6 text-sfa-navy hover:bg-sfa-navy hover:text-white\">Learn More About Us<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></a></div></div></section><section id=\"faq\" class=\"scroll-mt-20 bg-sfa-bg py-20 lg:py-28\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-sfa-orange\">FAQ</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-sfa-navy sm:text-4xl\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Quick answers to the most common questions from students and parents.</p></div><div class=\"mt-12 divide-y divide-border/60 rounded-2xl border border-border/50 bg-white shadow-sm\"><div><button id=\"faq-trigger-0\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-0\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50\"><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-sfa-navy sm:text-base\">Can I revise my downloaded papers without an Internet connection?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-5 shrink-0 text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div id=\"faq-panel-0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-trigger-0\" class=\"grid transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Yes! All past papers and course notes can be downloaded as PDFs for offline revision. Once downloaded, they are stored locally on your device so you can study anytime, anywhere, no data required.</p></div></div></div><div><button id=\"faq-trigger-1\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-1\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50\"><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-sfa-navy sm:text-base\">Are the solutions aligned with official GCE Board marking schemes?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-5 shrink-0 text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div id=\"faq-panel-1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-trigger-1\" class=\"grid transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Absolutely. Every solution and marking guide is prepared by qualified teachers and cross-checked against the official GCE Board marking schemes. Our video corrections follow the same methodology examiners use when grading your papers.</p></div></div></div><div><button id=\"faq-trigger-2\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-2\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50\"><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-sfa-navy sm:text-base\">Which subjects are available for Advanced Level?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-5 shrink-0 text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div id=\"faq-panel-2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-trigger-2\" class=\"grid transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">We cover a wide range of A-Level subjects including Mathematics, Further Maths, Physics, Chemistry, Biology, Computer Science, Economics, Accounting, English Language, French, History, Geography, and more. New subjects are added regularly.</p></div></div></div><div><button id=\"faq-trigger-3\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-3\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50\"><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-sfa-navy sm:text-base\">How do I order physical books from the library?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-5 shrink-0 text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div id=\"faq-panel-3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-trigger-3\" class=\"grid transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">Browse the Book Library section in the app, select the book you need, and tap 'Order'. You'll be prompted to provide a delivery address and pay via Mobile Money. Books are shipped within Cameroon and typically arrive within 3–5 business days.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-border/40 bg-white\"><div class=\"bg-linear-to-r from-sfa-navy via-[#0D1A8A] to-sfa-navy\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col items-center gap-6 px-4 py-14 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl\">Start Preparing for Your GCE Today</h2><p class=\"max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-blue-200\">Join thousands of Cameroonian students already using School For All to ace their Ordinary &amp; Advanced Level exams.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-3 sm:flex-row\"><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/school-for-all/id6806633738\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-40 items-center justify-center\"><img alt=\"Download on the App Store\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"380\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-full w-full object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://www.school-forall.com/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fappstore.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"></div></a><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.schoolforall.schoolforall\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-40 items-center justify-center\"><img alt=\"Get it on Google Play\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"768\" height=\"297\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-full w-full object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://www.school-forall.com/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fplaystore.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75\"></div></a></div></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-2